==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has reached a massive 110 million downloads worldwide! In thanks to all of our players, we've got special events available for a limited time!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 22nd, 2025 (11:00am) until January 9th, 2026 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Half-off level-up and evolution costs for all Cats!'''}}<br>
Give your Cats a quick boost while you can!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from January 1st (11:00am) until January 9th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 110 Million DL Celebration Stamps now available!'''}}<br>
Log in during the event to claim fantastic rewards! Log-in every day to {{Color|#4A86E8|'''earn up to 5 Cat Tickets and 5 Rare Tickets'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 22nd, 2025 (11:00am) until January 9th, 2026 (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 110 Million DL Celebration Missions on now!'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base and tap the Missions tab for limited-time 110 Million DL Missions!<br>
Clear all 110 Million DL Celebration Missions to earn a {{Color|#0000FF|'''Rare Ticket'''}}!<br>
Grab it while you can!<br>
※ These Special missions can only be completed until January 9th (10:59am), so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Download Celebration Stages on now!'''}}<br>
Earn Cat Tickets, XP, and items by clearing the Download Celebration Stages! Visit the Legend Stages from the title screen to access these limited-time stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・110M Celebration Gifts Galore! on now!'''}}<br>
The Battle Cats has hit 110 million downloads and a new stage "110M Celebration Gifts Galore!" is available to celebrate, with a {{Color|#34A853|'''20 Cat Food reward'''}} for clearing it.<br>
Once the stage is cleared, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''it will be reset at 12AM the next day and can be cleared again'''}} {{Color|#9900FF|'''for another 20 Cat Food reward'''}}!<br>
Clear the stage every day during the event to {{Color|#FF0000|'''earn up to 380 Cat Food'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・110 Million Downloads Celebration event on now!'''}}<br>
When The Battle Cats hits 110 million downloads, that means one thing - time to party with a spectacular festival!<br>
Clear event stages to earn {{Color|#FF9900|'''Starshines'''}} to use the Event Capsules!<br>
There is a higher chance of earning Starshines from later stages!<br>
Collect star fragments formed from the battle memories of 110 million players!<br>
※ After clearing 110 Million DL Celebration stages a certain number of times, there will be a short cooldown before you can challenge them again.<br>
※ Using a Catamin A will immediately grant you another stage attempt.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Map: "Fireworks Spectacular"'''}}<br>
The Fireworks Gang gets ready to blast off in a tough new map!<br>
Clear stages in this map to earn {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Legend Catseyes, Dark Catseyes, and a Rare Ticket'''}} among other rewards!<br>
※ "Fireworks Spectacular!" can be challenged at User Rank 1600 or higher.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Deadly Carnival I, II, & III'''}}<br>
The toughest test is here... can you stand the heat?<br>
See if YOU are up to the challenge of these Deadly-grade stages! Clear the first stage for a reward of 2 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
※ Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear. Players who have previously cleared Deadly Carnival I, Deadly Carnival II, or Deadly Carnival III will not be able to collect the rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''30,000,000 XP'''}} by clearing the stage!

Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next stage.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages with big XP rewards!

